<title>USA: New York physical copper market - July 24.</title>
<headline>New York physical copper market - July 24.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Based on COMEX settlement prices, merchant copper cathodes for July shipment were quoted at a nominal 112.40 to 112.90 cents a lb.</p>
<p>Dealers quoted No.2 scrap copper at a nominal 86.00 cents per lb, down 1.50 cents from July 23rd.</p>
<p>-- New York Commodity Desk, 212-859-1640</p>
</text>
